                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Configure tests that use "struct lock_manager_operations lm_ops" will fail after:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Linux commit v6.2-rc3-9-g5970e15dbcfe&lt;br/&gt;
filelock: move file locking definitions to separate header file&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Run LC_HAVE_LOCKS_LOCK_FILE_WAIT_IN_FILELOCK early so HAVE_LINUX_FILELOCK_HEADER is available for "struct lock_manager_operations" tests to conditionally include filelock.h&lt;/p&gt;</description>
